@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
scale max 800 width
top to bottom direction
skinparam padding 2
skinparam linetype ortho

title 3.3 — OMCS Compliance Audit: Entity Relationships

note as N1
  Submodule 3.3 is fully stateless.
  No rows are persisted to any database table.
  tbl_compliance_evaluation_result and
  tbl_compliance_revision_history were created
  in V5/V6 and dropped in V16 when the audit
  was reimplemented as a LangGraph omcs_agent.
  All audit results are returned in-memory only.
end note

entity "tbl_business_profile" as BP {
  * business_profile_id : UUID <<PK>>
  --
  * user_id             : UUID <<FK>>
  business_name         : TEXT
  categories            : TEXT
  uniqueness_score      : FLOAT
  ...
}

note bottom of BP
  3.3 reads business profile data
  from this table at audit time
  (via businessProfile payload field)
  but writes nothing back.
end note

@enduml
